# Cursor Rules

Adhere strictly to .agent-rules/systemic-integrity.md for all tasks, bug fixes, and code generation.
- Evidence Over Labels: Treat comments and docstrings as hypotheses; verify behavior against real call sites and test assertions.
- Docstring Rules:
  - Operational guarantees (O(1), thread-safe) must link to test fixtures (# verifies: tests/...).
  - Contextual comments must use structured prefixes: # Rationale:, # Workaround:, or # Assumption:.
  - Strip unverified marketing superlatives (universal, bulletproof, zero-dependency).
- Golden Test Protection: Files in tests/golden/ are immutable contracts during implementation.
- Root-Cause Resolution: Fix root causes at source; no broad exception swallowing or magic constants.
- Iteration Ceiling: Limit test-iteration loops to 4 runs maximum.
